573	     * Whether an existing owner has been soft-deleted. A soft-deleted owner retains its row but is
574	     * excluded from the create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks, so it never blocks the
575	     * creation of a new owner. A {@code null} flag (an owner predating the soft-delete column) is
576	     * treated as not deleted.
577	     *
578	     * @param owner an existing owner
579	     * @return {@code true} if the owner is flagged deleted
580	     */
581	    private boolean isDeleted(Owner owner) {
582	        return Boolean.TRUE.equals(owner.getDeleted());
